Throwaway RSA-2048 key, generated only to exercise the PKCS#8 PEM -> ring signing path
in bigquery.rs tests. It has never been near a Google project, protects nothing, and is
not used by any binary. Text before the BEGIN marker is legal PEM and is skipped by parsers.

